  sections  cited by
▸ Goal      no slice
      Say hello and goodbye to a person by name, in the tone the product has.
  Greeting  slice a
      Use the first name. Fall back to "friend" when there is none.
  Farewell  slice b
      Say goodbye politely, and never twice.
  Tone      slice c, d
      Casual or formal: the owner decides. Until then neither is shipped, so
      the copy waits for the answer.

